00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:54.180
Ça c'est le mec qui bute tous ceux qui rigolent pas.

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:57.520
Reynald, nettoyeur.

00:06:57.620 --> 00:07:02.160
*This is the rhythm oh the night, a night...*

